DDL:- Data Definition Language 
=>It used for define database structure.
=>It is used to crete structure of table.
COMMANDS:- CREATE,ALTER,DROP,TRUNCATE,RENAME 



CREATE:- It is used for create a table.
SYNTAX:- CREATE TABLE table_name(
col1 DATATYPE CONSTRAINT,
col2 DATATYPE CONSTRAINT,
col3 DATATYPE CONSTRAINT,
col4 DATATYPE CONSTRAINT
);



ALTER :- ITS used for modify the existing tables 
4 methods in ALTER 
i)ADD:-It is used adding new column in a table.
SYNTAX:- ALTER TABLE table_name ADD new_column;
ii)DROP:-IT is used for REMOVE a colum 
SYNTAX:-ALTER TABLE table_name DROP COLUMN column_name;
iii)MODIFY:-It is used foe changes datatype & size of cloumn.
SYNTAX:-ALTER TABLE table_name ALTER COLUMN column_name TYPE(SIZE);
iv):-RENAME:- IT IS used for change column name.
SYNTAX:-RENAME TABLE old_colum_namr TO new_column_name;







DROP:- It can delete total table and data permantly with table .
SYNTAX:-DROP TABLE table_name;






TURNCATE:- it can delete only data in the table.
SYNTAX:-TURNCATE TABLE table_name
